### ============================================================
### Bearer Token 认证测试
### 默认Token为: default-secret-token
### ============================================================

### 1. Bearer Token - 成功示例
# @name bearerSuccess
GET http://127.0.0.1:5176/auth/bearer
Authorization: Bearer default-secret-token

### 2. Bearer Token - 失败示例 (错误Token)
# @name bearerFailure
GET http://127.0.0.1:5176/auth/bearer
Authorization: Bearer wrong-secret-token


### ============================================================
### Signature 签名认证测试
### 默认Secret为: default-signature-secret
###
### 签名逻辑:
### 1. 获取当前时间戳 (X-Timestamp) 和一个随机字符串 (X-Nonce)
### 2. 构造待签名字符串: 请求方法 + "\n" + 请求路径 + "\n" + 时间戳 + "\n" + Nonce
###    例如: "GET\n/auth/signature\n1672502400000\nrandom-nonce-string"
### 3. 使用 HMAC-SHA256 算法和预共享的 Secret 对待签名字符串进行加密，并进行Base64编码，得到最终签名 (X-Api-Signature)
###
### 以下是一个在线生成签名的工具，方便您测试：
### https://www.freeformatter.com/hmac-generator.html
### (请确保选择 HMAC-SHA256 算法)
### ============================================================

### 3. Signature - 成功示例
# @name signatureSuccess
GET http://127.0.0.1:5176/auth/signature
X-Timestamp: {{timestamp}}
X-Nonce: {{nonce}}
X-Api-Signature: {{signature}}

< {%
    // 使用JavaScript动态生成签名
    const crypto = require('crypto');
    const secret = "default-signature-secret";
    const timestamp = Date.now();
    const nonce = crypto.randomBytes(16).toString('hex');
    const stringToSign = `GET\n/auth/signature\n${timestamp}\n${nonce}`;

    const hmac = crypto.createHmac('sha256', secret);
    hmac.update(stringToSign);
    const signature = hmac.digest('base64');

    // 设置环境变量，供HTTP请求使用
    request.variables.set("timestamp", timestamp);
    request.variables.set("nonce", nonce);
    request.variables.set("signature", signature);
%}

### 4. Signature - 失败示例 (错误签名)
# @name signatureFailure
GET http://127.0.0.1:5176/auth/signature
X-Timestamp: {{timestamp}}
X-Nonce: {{nonce}}
X-Api-Signature: wrong-signature-string

< {%
    const crypto = require('crypto');
    request.variables.set("timestamp", Date.now());
    request.variables.set("nonce", crypto.randomBytes(16).toString('hex'));
%}
